sequenceDiagram
  title A pull request
  actor Dev as Developer
  participant Forge
  participant CI
  actor Rev as Reviewer
  Dev->>Forge: open the pull request
  Forge->>CI: run the checks
  CI-->>Forge: all green
  Forge->>Rev: ask for a review
  loop until approved
    Rev->>Forge: comment
    Forge->>Dev: changes requested
    Dev->>Forge: push a fix
  end
  Rev->>Forge: approve
  Note over Dev,Rev: one more look at the diff
  Dev->>Forge: merge
